  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> Farum is charged.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You invoke Alkhys to use Farum’s charged power to rewrite the parameters of your next spell. If your next action is to Cast a Spell, you can use a spellshape that you know as part of this action and cast it as a runic spell with this runeword. Farum is no longer charged.</p>"
